# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example: SQD on N$_2$ {#large-scale-hardware-example-sqd-on-n-2}"
msgstr "Contoh perkakasan berskala besar: SQD pada N$_2$ {#large-scale-hardware-example-sqd-on-n-2}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we put all components together into a complete quantum chemistry workflow at a larger scale, executed on real IBM Quantum hardware through QRMI.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kami menggabungkan semua komponen ke dalam aliran kerja kimia kuantum yang lengkap pada skala yang lebih besar, dilaksanakan pada perkakasan IBM Quantum sebenar melalui QRMI.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**SQD** combines the following:\n"
"1. Quantum sampling of a Local Unitary Cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) ansatz constructed using `ffsim` and initialized from CCSD amplitudes\n"
"2. Hardware-aware transpilation matching the heavy-hex lattice topology via `generate_lucj_pass_manager`\n"
"3. Sampling execution on IBM Quantum hardware managed through `QRMIService` and QRMI `SamplerV2`\n"
"4. Classical post-processing: self-consistent configuration recovery and iterative subspace diagonalization using `qiskit-addon-sqd`\n"
msgstr ""
"**SQD** menggabungkan yang berikut:\n"
"1. Pensampelan kuantum ansatz Local Unitary Cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) yang dibina menggunakan `ffsim` dan dimulakan daripada amplitud CCSD\n"
"2. Transpilation sedar-perkakasan yang sepadan dengan topologi kekisi heavy-hex melalui `generate_lucj_pass_manager`\n"
"3. Pelaksanaan pensampelan pada perkakasan IBM Quantum yang diuruskan melalui `QRMIService` dan QRMI `SamplerV2`\n"
"4. Pasca-pemprosesan klasik: pemulihan konfigurasi swakonsisten dan pendiagonalan subruang berulang menggunakan `qiskit-addon-sqd`\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We apply SQD to N$_2$ at a bond distance of 1.0 $\\AA$ with an active space derived from the `cc-pVDZ` basis set (26 spatial orbitals, corresponding to 52 spin-orbitals/qubits).\n"
msgstr "Kami menggunakan SQD pada N$_2$ pada jarak ikatan 1.0 $\\AA$ dengan ruang aktif yang diperoleh daripada set asas `cc-pVDZ` (26 orbital spatial, bersamaan dengan 52 spin-orbital/Qubit).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Reference energy for N$_2$ /cc-pVDZ active space (bond distance 1.0 $\\AA$):**\n"
"- Reference energy (separate SCI calculation): **−109.22802922 Ha**\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tenaga rujukan untuk ruang aktif N$_2$ /cc-pVDZ (jarak ikatan 1.0 $\\AA$):**\n"
"- Tenaga rujukan (pengiraan SCI berasingan): **−109.22802922 Ha**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Accuracy of the saved run\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Ketepatan larian yang disimpan\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The SQD run below demonstrates successful end-to-end QRMI execution on IBM Quantum hardware. With a single LUCJ repetition and 100,000 shots the result finishes approximately 23.7 kcal/mol above the reference energy and does not achieve chemical accuracy (≤ 1 kcal/mol). Changing `n_reps`, the shot count, or the number of SQD iterations might improve accuracy, but requires further testing.\n"
msgstr "Larian SQD di bawah menunjukkan pelaksanaan QRMI hujung-ke-hujung yang berjaya pada perkakasan IBM Quantum. Dengan satu ulangan LUCJ dan 100,000 shot, hasilnya berakhir kira-kira 23.7 kcal/mol di atas tenaga rujukan dan tidak mencapai ketepatan kimia (≤ 1 kcal/mol). Menukar `n_reps`, bilangan shot, atau bilangan iterasi SQD mungkin dapat meningkatkan ketepatan, tetapi memerlukan ujian lanjut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the saved run, the `ffsim` pass manager removed the opposite-spin interactions `(24, 24)` and `(20, 20)` because the backend could not accommodate them. The reported results use this adjusted circuit.\n"
msgstr "Dalam larian yang disimpan, pengurus laluan `ffsim` mengalih keluar interaksi putaran bertentangan `(24, 24)` dan `(20, 20)` kerana Backend tidak dapat menampungnya. Hasil yang dilaporkan menggunakan Circuit yang telah diselaraskan ini.\n"

